<title>USA: Coors 1996 and Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Coors 1996 and Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>For quarter ended December 29:</p>
<p>			 1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary     $0.10		    $0.16</p>
<p> Oper shr profit $0.23	 loss     $0.08</p>
<p> Net		 3,961		    6,159</p>
<p> Revs		404,122		  415,565</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary37,921,000	     37,925,000</p>
<p>For year ended December 29:</p>
<p> Shr primary     $1.14		    $1.13</p>
<p> Oper shr	  $1.24		    $0.89</p>
<p> Net		 43,425		   43,178</p>
<p> Revs		1,732,233		1,679,586</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary37,990,676	     38,170,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full name is Adoloph Coors Co.</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 net income per share included a $7.9 million pre-tax charge attributable to legal expenses from the 1993 sale of Molson Breweries.</p>
<p>Full-year net income per share includes a $5.2 million pretax charge in the second quarter related to the Molson peoceedings, as well as a $6.7 million pre-tax credit in the third quarter related to underpaid past royalities and interest from Molson.</p>
</text>
